BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ce312a7a-051e-3bce-a811-76e8661af2d0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
